            "answer": "<p>CHANCE 2.0 is one iconic engraving offered in six performance grades — Classic, Mediflex, Outdoor, Bioblend, Crib 7 / B1 and Crib 5. You keep the same signature CHANCE look across a project and choose the grade that meets each space's fire, hygiene, sustainability or weather requirement.</p>"
